{"id":"forecast-17","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-17/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":316.23,"segments":[{"start":0.46,"end":5.42,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 14.","words":[["Now",0.46,1.04],["listen",1.04,1.42],["carefully",1.42,1.9],["and",1.9,2.64],["answer",2.64,3.1],["questions",3.1,3.76],["11",3.76,4.58],["to",4.58,4.88],["14.",4.88,5.42]]},{"start":6.16,"end":8.48,"text":"Welcome to our holiday special.","words":[["Welcome",6.16,6.92],["to",6.92,7.28],["our",7.28,7.56],["holiday",7.56,8.04],["special.",8.04,8.48]]},{"start":9.1,"end":14.94,"text":"Today I'll be talking about a new cycle route in this area called the Amsdon Way.","words":[["Today",9.1,9.44],["I'll",9.44,9.92],["be",9.92,10.08],["talking",10.08,10.46],["about",10.46,10.9],["a",10.9,11.16],["new",11.16,11.42],["cycle",11.42,11.8],["route",11.8,12.18],["in",12.18,12.44],["this",12.44,12.7],["area",12.7,13.16],["called",13.16,13.58],["the",13.58,14.02],["Amsdon",14.02,14.62],["Way.",14.62,14.94]]},{"start":15.5,"end":19.6,"text":"It's well signposted so you can see exactly where to go.","words":[["It's",15.5,15.86],["well",15.86,16.12],["signposted",16.12,17.12],["so",17.12,17.5],["you",17.5,17.74],["can",17.74,17.92],["see",17.92,18.16],["exactly",18.16,18.84],["where",18.84,19.16],["to",19.16,19.34],["go.",19.34,19.6]]},{"start":20.04,"end":22.94,"text":"And it's an easy route with no steep hills.","words":[["And",20.04,20.44],["it's",20.44,20.68],["an",20.68,20.82],["easy",20.82,21.16],["route",21.16,21.54],["with",21.54,21.82],["no",21.82,22.14],["steep",22.14,22.48],["hills.",22.48,22.94]]},{"start":22.94,"end":31.66,"text":"It's 35 kilometers long from Amsterdam to Lovington and consists partly of cycle paths and partly roads.","words":[["It's",22.94,23.8],["35",23.8,24.32],["kilometers",24.32,24.9],["long",24.9,25.44],["from",25.44,25.96],["Amsterdam",25.96,26.46],["to",26.46,26.8],["Lovington",26.8,27.44],["and",27.44,28.18],["consists",28.18,28.72],["partly",28.72,29.24],["of",29.24,29.52],["cycle",29.52,29.92],["paths",29.92,30.38],["and",30.38,30.76],["partly",30.76,31.2],["roads.",31.2,31.66]]},{"start":32.18,"end":36.98,"text":"Let me outline the route briefly starting at Amsterdam Railway Station.","words":[["Let",32.18,32.78],["me",32.78,32.98],["outline",32.98,33.48],["the",33.48,33.72],["route",33.72,33.98],["briefly",33.98,34.44],["starting",34.44,35.04],["at",35.04,35.4],["Amsterdam",35.4,35.88],["Railway",35.88,36.52],["Station.",36.52,36.98]]},{"start":37.66,"end":43.28,"text":"The first part is a cycle path running eastwards, roughly parallel to the rail track.","words":[["The",37.66,37.98],["first",37.98,38.28],["part",38.28,38.6],["is",38.6,38.9],["a",38.9,39.06],["cycle",39.06,39.4],["path",39.4,39.8],["running",39.8,40.12],["eastwards,",40.12,40.82],["roughly",41.02,41.58],["parallel",41.58,42.08],["to",42.08,42.48],["the",42.48,42.66],["rail",42.66,42.9],["track.",42.9,43.28]]},{"start":43.86,"end":49.94,"text":"Almost immediately, the railway curves away and goes around the southern side of a little lake.","words":[["Almost",43.86,44.24],["immediately,",44.24,44.8],["the",45.38,45.54],["railway",45.54,45.98],["curves",45.98,46.52],["away",46.52,46.9],["and",46.9,47.36],["goes",47.36,47.62],["around",47.62,48.0],["the",48.0,48.22],["southern",48.22,48.5],["side",48.5,48.94],["of",48.94,49.18],["a",49.18,49.32],["little",49.32,49.56],["lake.",49.56,49.94]]},{"start":49.94,"end":53.86,"text":"But the cycle path takes the northern route around the lake.","words":[["But",49.94,50.72],["the",50.72,50.94],["cycle",50.94,51.26],["path",51.26,51.64],["takes",51.64,51.98],["the",51.98,52.18],["northern",52.18,52.52],["route",52.52,52.88],["around",52.88,53.28],["the",53.28,53.56],["lake.",53.56,53.86]]},{"start":54.24,"end":57.34,"text":"Keep your eyes open for the swans that nest there.","words":[["Keep",54.24,54.56],["your",54.56,54.8],["eyes",54.8,55.12],["open",55.12,55.56],["for",55.56,55.76],["the",55.76,55.92],["swans",55.92,56.36],["that",56.36,56.64],["nest",56.64,57.02],["there.",57.02,57.34]]},{"start":58.06,"end":64.56,"text":"The path then joins the road and the next landmark is a group of massive rocks which tower over","words":[["The",58.06,58.3],["path",58.3,58.66],["then",58.66,58.94],["joins",58.94,59.3],["the",59.3,59.56],["road",59.56,59.86],["and",59.86,60.34],["the",60.34,60.5],["next",60.5,60.78],["landmark",60.78,61.28],["is",61.28,61.72],["a",61.72,61.9],["group",61.9,62.06],["of",62.06,62.28],["massive",62.28,62.7],["rocks",62.7,63.16],["which",63.16,63.72],["tower",63.72,64.2],["over",64.2,64.56]]},{"start":64.56,"end":65.3,"text":"the countryside.","words":[["the",64.56,64.78],["countryside.",64.78,65.3]]},{"start":66.18,"end":71.32,"text":"You will see them to the east of the road just before the road goes under the railway.","words":[["You",66.18,66.48],["will",66.48,66.66],["see",66.66,66.94],["them",66.94,67.18],["to",67.18,67.4],["the",67.4,67.58],["east",67.58,67.88],["of",67.88,68.08],["the",68.08,68.2],["road",68.2,68.56],["just",68.56,69.08],["before",69.08,69.46],["the",69.46,69.7],["road",69.7,70.02],["goes",70.02,70.26],["under",70.26,70.7],["the",70.7,70.92],["railway.",70.92,71.32]]},{"start":71.92,"end":73.36,"text":"They are very impressive.","words":[["They",71.92,72.24],["are",72.24,72.38],["very",72.38,72.74],["impressive.",72.74,73.36]]},{"start":74.12,"end":79.14,"text":"Soon, you'll come to a fork in the road where you're going to leave the road and","words":[["Soon,",74.12,74.6],["you'll",74.94,75.2],["come",75.2,75.44],["to",75.44,75.68],["a",75.68,75.92],["fork",75.92,76.12],["in",76.12,76.42],["the",76.42,76.56],["road",76.56,76.92],["where",76.92,77.36],["you're",77.36,77.64],["going",77.64,77.84],["to",77.84,78.06],["leave",78.06,78.36],["the",78.36,78.58],["road",78.58,78.88],["and",78.88,79.14]]},{"start":79.14,"end":85.3,"text":"head off toward the river. But if you want to make a detour to Colleen Nature Reserve,","words":[["head",79.14,79.42],["off",79.42,79.7],["toward",79.7,80.06],["the",80.06,80.3],["river.",80.3,80.56],["But",81.22,81.58],["if",81.58,81.88],["you",81.88,82.04],["want",82.04,82.22],["to",82.22,82.42],["make",82.42,82.62],["a",82.62,82.78],["detour",82.78,83.32],["to",83.32,83.76],["Colleen",83.76,84.34],["Nature",84.34,84.74],["Reserve,",84.74,85.3]]},{"start":85.68,"end":92.26,"text":"go straight on instead of leaving the road here. Continuing along the cycle path, you'll","words":[["go",85.68,85.84],["straight",85.84,86.26],["on",86.26,86.62],["instead",86.62,87.12],["of",87.12,87.44],["leaving",87.44,87.7],["the",87.7,87.98],["road",87.98,88.28],["here.",88.28,88.62],["Continuing",89.44,90.0],["along",90.0,90.56],["the",90.56,90.84],["cycle",90.84,91.16],["path,",91.16,91.6],["you'll",91.98,92.26]]},{"start":92.26,"end":98.92,"text":"reach the river cleave. The cycle path follows the river southwards. After a bit, you'll","words":[["reach",92.26,92.56],["the",92.56,92.76],["river",92.76,93.04],["cleave.",93.04,93.7],["The",94.08,94.26],["cycle",94.26,94.62],["path",94.62,94.98],["follows",94.98,95.46],["the",95.46,95.76],["river",95.76,96.06],["southwards.",96.06,96.84],["After",97.4,97.76],["a",97.76,98.0],["bit,",98.0,98.18],["you'll",98.58,98.92]]},{"start":98.92,"end":106.5,"text":"see the Ashingtonshina factory, which closed in 1962. When you get there, there's a bridge","words":[["see",98.92,99.18],["the",99.18,99.4],["Ashingtonshina",99.4,100.52],["factory,",100.52,100.94],["which",101.32,101.64],["closed",101.64,102.16],["in",102.16,102.44],["1962.",102.44,103.44],["When",104.34,104.64],["you",104.64,104.84],["get",104.84,105.06],["there,",105.06,105.38],["there's",105.66,106.04],["a",106.04,106.18],["bridge",106.18,106.5]]},{"start":106.5,"end":112.86,"text":"over the river and you carry on with Langton Forest to the south and Farmland to the north.","words":[["over",106.5,106.9],["the",106.9,107.12],["river",107.12,107.4],["and",107.4,107.96],["you",107.96,108.14],["carry",108.14,108.48],["on",108.48,108.88],["with",108.88,109.3],["Langton",109.3,109.76],["Forest",109.76,110.14],["to",110.14,110.46],["the",110.46,110.66],["south",110.66,110.98],["and",110.98,111.48],["Farmland",111.48,112.1],["to",112.1,112.4],["the",112.4,112.56],["north.",112.56,112.86]]},{"start":113.44,"end":119.62,"text":"The route ends at Langton Village, where you'll find a railway station, so you can either","words":[["The",113.44,113.62],["route",113.62,113.88],["ends",113.88,114.26],["at",114.26,114.44],["Langton",114.44,114.92],["Village,",114.92,115.26],["where",115.66,115.92],["you'll",115.92,116.24],["find",116.24,116.5],["a",116.5,116.72],["railway",116.72,117.02],["station,",117.02,117.66],["so",118.14,118.52],["you",118.52,119.06],["can",119.06,119.26],["either",119.26,119.62]]},{"start":119.62,"end":122.92,"text":"catch the train here or cycle back to Amston.","words":[["catch",119.62,119.96],["the",119.96,120.2],["train",120.2,120.56],["here",120.56,120.84],["or",120.84,121.14],["cycle",121.14,121.6],["back",121.6,121.96],["to",121.96,122.24],["Amston.",122.24,122.92]]},{"start":123.92,"end":130.26,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the program, you have some time to look at Questions 15","words":[["Before",123.92,124.6],["you",124.6,125.02],["hear",125.02,125.3],["the",125.3,125.5],["rest",125.5,125.84],["of",125.84,126.02],["the",126.02,126.18],["program,",126.18,126.7],["you",127.1,127.36],["have",127.36,127.58],["some",127.58,127.76],["time",127.76,128.14],["to",128.14,128.36],["look",128.36,128.62],["at",128.62,128.94],["Questions",128.94,129.36],["15",129.36,130.26]]},{"start":130.26,"end":132.12,"text":"to 20 and to 20.","words":[["to",130.26,130.54],["20",130.54,131.16],["and",131.16,131.56],["to",131.56,131.7],["20.",131.7,132.12]]},{"start":132.12,"end":137.1,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 15 to 20.","words":[["Now",132.12,133.44],["listen",133.44,133.84],["and",133.84,134.28],["answer",134.28,134.82],["questions",134.82,135.38],["15",135.38,136.38],["to",136.38,136.64],["20.",136.64,137.1]]},{"start":137.68,"end":143.32,"text":"One point to remember when you're cycling on the Amston Way is that you should keep your","words":[["One",137.68,138.38],["point",138.38,138.7],["to",138.7,138.94],["remember",138.94,139.34],["when",139.34,139.68],["you're",139.68,139.9],["cycling",139.9,140.36],["on",140.36,140.74],["the",140.74,140.88],["Amston",140.88,141.34],["Way",141.34,141.74],["is",141.74,142.28],["that",142.28,142.46],["you",142.46,142.64],["should",142.64,142.84],["keep",142.84,143.1],["your",143.1,143.32]]},{"start":143.32,"end":149.6,"text":"eyes open for sheep which occasionally stray onto the cycle path from adjoining fields.","words":[["eyes",143.32,143.68],["open",143.68,144.1],["for",144.1,144.34],["sheep",144.34,144.74],["which",144.74,145.02],["occasionally",145.02,145.84],["stray",145.84,146.36],["onto",146.36,146.8],["the",146.8,147.04],["cycle",147.04,147.4],["path",147.4,147.76],["from",147.76,148.42],["adjoining",148.42,149.04],["fields.",149.04,149.6]]},{"start":150.04,"end":152.4,"text":"So be careful to avoid accidents.","words":[["So",150.04,150.38],["be",150.38,150.6],["careful",150.6,151.1],["to",151.1,151.34],["avoid",151.34,151.8],["accidents.",151.8,152.4]]},{"start":153.26,"end":158.6,"text":"The path is well constructed so it's not affected by wet or muddy conditions.","words":[["The",153.26,153.58],["path",153.58,153.9],["is",153.9,154.14],["well",154.14,154.48],["constructed",154.48,155.1],["so",155.1,155.74],["it's",155.74,156.06],["not",156.06,156.24],["affected",156.24,156.74],["by",156.74,157.06],["wet",157.06,157.42],["or",157.42,157.68],["muddy",157.68,157.98],["conditions.",157.98,158.6]]},{"start":158.6,"end":164.58,"text":"There might be the odd car or tractor when you're cycling on roads, but most traffic","words":[["There",158.6,159.54],["might",159.54,159.82],["be",159.82,160.12],["the",160.12,160.3],["odd",160.3,160.62],["car",160.62,160.96],["or",160.96,161.2],["tractor",161.2,161.64],["when",161.64,161.94],["you're",161.94,162.14],["cycling",162.14,162.5],["on",162.5,162.78],["roads,",162.78,163.12],["but",163.46,163.8],["most",163.8,164.16],["traffic",164.16,164.58]]},{"start":164.58,"end":168.94,"text":"has been diverted to the main road that bypasses the whole area.","words":[["has",164.58,164.96],["been",164.96,165.18],["diverted",165.18,165.68],["to",165.68,165.96],["the",165.96,166.1],["main",166.1,166.4],["road",166.4,166.74],["that",166.74,167.14],["bypasses",167.14,167.94],["the",167.94,168.1],["whole",168.1,168.44],["area.",168.44,168.94]]},{"start":169.82,"end":173.02,"text":"Now, a bit more about some of the places you'll see.","words":[["Now,",169.82,170.16],["a",170.38,170.5],["bit",170.5,170.68],["more",170.68,170.98],["about",170.98,171.3],["some",171.3,171.7],["of",171.7,171.9],["the",171.9,172.02],["places",172.02,172.36],["you'll",172.36,172.74],["see.",172.74,173.02]]},{"start":173.58,"end":180.02,"text":"The starting point, Amstin Station, was quite busy in the early 20th century with services","words":[["The",173.58,173.74],["starting",173.74,174.12],["point,",174.12,174.52],["Amstin",174.86,175.3],["Station,",175.3,175.74],["was",176.14,176.4],["quite",176.4,176.78],["busy",176.78,177.18],["in",177.18,177.46],["the",177.46,177.56],["early",177.56,177.92],["20th",177.92,178.56],["century",178.56,178.98],["with",178.98,179.48],["services",179.48,180.02]]},{"start":180.02,"end":181.68,"text":"to several major cities.","words":[["to",180.02,180.34],["several",180.34,180.84],["major",180.84,181.22],["cities.",181.22,181.68]]},{"start":182.3,"end":185.2,"text":"But it was closed in the 1950s.","words":[["But",182.3,182.66],["it",182.66,182.88],["was",182.88,183.08],["closed",183.08,183.46],["in",183.46,183.78],["the",183.78,183.88],["1950s.",183.88,185.2]]},{"start":185.2,"end":192.26,"text":"And, actually, a small company was set up to turn it into a sort of railway museum, maintaining","words":[["And,",185.2,185.86],["actually,",185.96,186.4],["a",186.74,186.98],["small",186.98,187.24],["company",187.24,187.74],["was",187.74,187.98],["set",187.98,188.32],["up",188.32,188.52],["to",188.52,188.9],["turn",188.9,189.2],["it",189.2,189.36],["into",189.36,189.62],["a",189.62,189.84],["sort",189.84,190.04],["of",190.04,190.22],["railway",190.22,190.56],["museum,",190.56,191.42],["maintaining",191.7,192.26]]},{"start":192.26,"end":195.04,"text":"it in the style of the 1950s.","words":[["it",192.26,192.58],["in",192.58,192.78],["the",192.78,192.9],["style",192.9,193.36],["of",193.36,193.6],["the",193.6,193.7],["1950s.",193.7,195.04]]},{"start":195.44,"end":200.66,"text":"And the station was ready for trains to start using it again earlier this year.","words":[["And",195.44,195.8],["the",195.8,196.02],["station",196.02,196.38],["was",196.38,196.64],["ready",196.64,197.0],["for",197.0,197.26],["trains",197.26,197.66],["to",197.66,197.92],["start",197.92,198.2],["using",198.2,198.6],["it",198.6,198.84],["again",198.84,199.18],["earlier",199.18,199.82],["this",199.82,200.32],["year.",200.32,200.66]]},{"start":201.32,"end":204.34,"text":"It's only used by a few local trains, though.","words":[["It's",201.32,201.76],["only",201.76,202.06],["used",202.06,202.48],["by",202.48,202.7],["a",202.7,202.9],["few",202.9,203.06],["local",203.06,203.46],["trains,",203.46,204.08],["though.",204.12,204.34]]},{"start":205.02,"end":210.08,"text":"There's a visitor's center at the station, which has a small exhibition about the history","words":[["There's",205.02,205.32],["a",205.32,205.46],["visitor's",205.46,206.04],["center",206.04,206.3],["at",206.3,206.6],["the",206.6,206.76],["station,",206.76,207.18],["which",207.36,207.7],["has",207.7,207.94],["a",207.94,208.1],["small",208.1,208.38],["exhibition",208.38,209.06],["about",209.06,209.48],["the",209.48,209.72],["history",209.72,210.08]]},{"start":210.08,"end":216.74,"text":"of railway transport all over the world and a facility for hiring bikes if you don't have","words":[["of",210.08,210.34],["railway",210.34,210.72],["transport",210.72,211.4],["all",211.4,212.08],["over",212.08,212.46],["the",212.46,212.64],["world",212.64,213.08],["and",213.08,213.84],["a",213.84,214.02],["facility",214.02,214.44],["for",214.44,214.76],["hiring",214.76,215.1],["bikes",215.1,215.54],["if",215.54,216.06],["you",216.06,216.2],["don't",216.2,216.52],["have",216.52,216.74]]},{"start":216.74,"end":222.92,"text":"one of your own. There's also a small shop just across the road from the station that sells","words":[["one",216.74,217.02],["of",217.02,217.22],["your",217.22,217.36],["own.",217.36,217.72],["There's",218.24,218.68],["also",218.68,219.04],["a",219.04,219.24],["small",219.24,219.6],["shop",219.6,220.02],["just",220.02,220.32],["across",220.32,220.64],["the",220.64,220.96],["road",220.96,221.2],["from",221.2,221.44],["the",221.44,221.56],["station",221.56,222.0],["that",222.0,222.56],["sells",222.56,222.92]]},{"start":222.92,"end":230.8,"text":"refreshments. As I said, you can cycle to Langton and return to Amston by train or the other way","words":[["refreshments.",222.92,223.74],["As",224.42,224.68],["I",224.68,224.88],["said,",224.88,225.16],["you",225.62,225.7],["can",225.7,225.88],["cycle",225.88,226.26],["to",226.26,226.52],["Langton",226.52,226.98],["and",226.98,227.48],["return",227.48,227.92],["to",227.92,228.16],["Amston",228.16,228.7],["by",228.7,228.92],["train",228.92,229.38],["or",229.38,229.98],["the",229.98,230.24],["other",230.24,230.52],["way",230.52,230.8]]},{"start":230.8,"end":237.4,"text":"around because you can take your cycle on the train. There's no need to book, there's plenty","words":[["around",230.8,231.26],["because",231.26,231.84],["you",231.84,232.14],["can",232.14,232.36],["take",232.36,232.64],["your",232.64,232.86],["cycle",232.86,233.34],["on",233.34,233.74],["the",233.74,233.9],["train.",233.9,234.28],["There's",234.74,235.14],["no",235.14,235.38],["need",235.38,235.66],["to",235.66,235.86],["book,",235.86,236.14],["there's",236.6,237.06],["plenty",237.06,237.4]]},{"start":237.4,"end":239.54,"text":"of room and no extra charge.","words":[["of",237.4,237.66],["room",237.66,237.92],["and",237.92,238.24],["no",238.24,238.5],["extra",238.5,238.98],["charge.",238.98,239.54]]},{"start":240.02,"end":242.72,"text":"However, the service is very limited.","words":[["However,",240.02,240.46],["the",240.88,241.02],["service",241.02,241.4],["is",241.4,241.78],["very",241.78,242.2],["limited.",242.2,242.72]]},{"start":243.38,"end":247.78,"text":"And the trains between these two places don't run on weekdays.","words":[["And",243.38,243.58],["the",243.58,243.7],["trains",243.7,244.06],["between",244.06,244.48],["these",244.48,244.9],["two",244.9,245.16],["places",245.16,245.66],["don't",245.66,246.5],["run",246.5,246.8],["on",246.8,247.08],["weekdays.",247.08,247.78]]},{"start":248.6,"end":253.22,"text":"If you want to see the River Elm, there's a footpath from Amsdon Station.","words":[["If",248.6,248.98],["you",248.98,249.16],["want",249.16,249.38],["to",249.38,249.54],["see",249.54,249.74],["the",249.74,249.94],["River",249.94,250.18],["Elm,",250.18,250.7],["there's",250.94,251.24],["a",251.24,251.4],["footpath",251.4,251.88],["from",251.88,252.2],["Amsdon",252.2,252.74],["Station.",252.74,253.22]]},{"start":253.9,"end":257.16,"text":"And you can safely leave your bike in the car park there.","words":[["And",253.9,254.18],["you",254.18,254.34],["can",254.34,254.52],["safely",254.52,255.06],["leave",255.06,255.34],["your",255.34,255.54],["bike",255.54,255.86],["in",255.86,256.08],["the",256.08,256.2],["car",256.2,256.46],["park",256.46,256.84],["there.",256.84,257.16]]},{"start":257.78,"end":260.02,"text":"Leave yourself plenty of time, though.","words":[["Leave",257.78,258.26],["yourself",258.26,258.68],["plenty",258.68,259.14],["of",259.14,259.42],["time,",259.42,259.78],["though.",259.96,260.02]]},{"start":260.58,"end":264.22,"text":"Going down's easy, but the climb up is very steep.","words":[["Going",260.58,260.9],["down's",260.9,261.42],["easy,",261.42,261.8],["but",262.04,262.28],["the",262.28,262.44],["climb",262.44,262.74],["up",262.74,263.1],["is",263.1,263.42],["very",263.42,263.8],["steep.",263.8,264.22]]},{"start":264.22,"end":270.64,"text":"So, the walk back up to the top can take quite a while, but it's worth the effort.","words":[["So,",264.22,265.04],["the",265.18,265.32],["walk",265.32,265.58],["back",265.58,265.9],["up",265.9,266.22],["to",266.22,266.4],["the",266.4,266.54],["top",266.54,266.82],["can",266.82,267.18],["take",267.18,267.54],["quite",267.54,267.94],["a",267.94,268.16],["while,",268.16,268.48],["but",269.0,269.36],["it's",269.36,269.74],["worth",269.74,270.02],["the",270.02,270.28],["effort.",270.28,270.64]]},{"start":271.22,"end":277.98,"text":"The scenery is wonderful, and the footpath runs right next to the river, down to a waterfall.","words":[["The",271.22,271.4],["scenery",271.4,271.78],["is",271.78,272.3],["wonderful,",272.3,272.88],["and",273.42,273.78],["the",273.78,273.92],["footpath",273.92,274.44],["runs",274.44,274.86],["right",274.86,275.22],["next",275.22,275.58],["to",275.58,275.84],["the",275.84,276.0],["river,",276.0,276.3],["down",276.64,277.04],["to",277.04,277.3],["a",277.3,277.48],["waterfall.",277.48,277.98]]},{"start":278.94,"end":284.86,"text":"Finally, if you'd like to do some more cycling in the area, there are lots of other cycle","words":[["Finally,",278.94,279.44],["if",279.88,280.1],["you'd",280.1,280.34],["like",280.34,280.5],["to",280.5,280.74],["do",280.74,280.92],["some",280.92,281.16],["more",281.16,281.42],["cycling",281.42,281.86],["in",281.86,282.2],["the",282.2,282.36],["area,",282.36,282.76],["there",283.04,283.28],["are",283.28,283.48],["lots",283.48,283.84],["of",283.84,284.1],["other",284.1,284.46],["cycle",284.46,284.86]]},{"start":284.86,"end":285.26,"text":"paths.","words":[["paths.",284.86,285.26]]},{"start":285.98,"end":291.16,"text":"We'll be talking on the radio about them, and you'll be able to get full details","words":[["We'll",285.98,286.38],["be",286.38,286.52],["talking",286.52,286.86],["on",286.86,287.2],["the",287.2,287.34],["radio",287.34,287.8],["about",287.8,288.1],["them,",288.1,288.48],["and",288.72,289.1],["you'll",289.1,289.36],["be",289.36,289.52],["able",289.52,289.82],["to",289.82,290.04],["get",290.04,290.26],["full",290.26,290.62],["details",290.62,291.16]]},{"start":291.16,"end":294.02,"text":"in the Saturday edition of the local paper.","words":[["in",291.16,291.58],["the",291.58,291.7],["Saturday",291.7,292.16],["edition",292.16,292.78],["of",292.78,293.08],["the",293.08,293.24],["local",293.24,293.56],["paper.",293.56,294.02]]},{"start":294.86,"end":299.4,"text":"The National Cycle Network also has some details on their website,","words":[["The",294.86,295.16],["National",295.16,295.58],["Cycle",295.58,296.12],["Network",296.12,296.56],["also",296.56,297.3],["has",297.3,297.64],["some",297.64,297.94],["details",297.94,298.36],["on",298.36,298.74],["their",298.74,298.92],["website,",298.92,299.4]]},{"start":299.82,"end":303.32,"text":"although I have to say they don't have many local ones yet,","words":[["although",299.82,300.2],["I",300.2,300.6],["have",300.6,300.88],["to",300.88,301.04],["say",301.04,301.3],["they",301.3,301.5],["don't",301.5,301.84],["have",301.84,302.0],["many",302.0,302.3],["local",302.3,302.66],["ones",302.66,303.04],["yet,",303.04,303.32]]},{"start":303.74,"end":305.14,"text":"but that may change.","words":[["but",303.74,304.06],["that",304.06,304.36],["may",304.36,304.64],["change.",304.64,305.14]]},{"start":305.82,"end":308.16,"text":"So we'll be telling you more about...","words":[["So",305.82,306.16],["we'll",306.16,306.52],["be",306.52,306.66],["telling",306.66,306.98],["you",306.98,307.28],["more",307.28,307.58],["about...",307.58,308.16]]},{"start":308.74,"end":311.38,"text":"That is the end of section 2.","words":[["That",308.74,309.26],["is",309.26,309.68],["the",309.68,309.86],["end",309.86,310.28],["of",310.28,310.5],["section",310.5,310.82],["2.",310.82,311.38]]},{"start":312.0,"end":315.32,"text":"You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["You",312.0,312.28],["now",312.28,312.62],["have",312.62,313.0],["half",313.0,313.36],["a",313.36,313.6],["minute",313.6,313.88],["to",313.88,314.22],["check",314.22,314.56],["your",314.56,314.82],["answers.",314.82,315.32]]}]}